Hello Steffi,

It is fine to use either method. You are correct if you use repetitions, then you would supply 1s to represent the repeat lengths. If you use base pairs, then it's a good idea to pass the repeat lengths through the fix_replen() function beforehand to avoid rounding errors.

I hope that helps.

Best,

Zhian

